#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:649
#, no-c-format
msgid "Used to limit unroll factor which indicates how much the autovectorizer may unroll a loop.  The default value is 4."
msgstr "Gebruik na limiet rol uit faktor wat indicates how much die autovectorizer mag rol uit a lus. Die verstek waarde is 4."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:655
#, no-c-format
msgid "When costing for loop vectorization, we probably need to penalize the loop body cost if the existing cost model may not adequately reflect delays from unavailable vector resources.  We collect the cost for vectorized statements and non-vectorized statements separately, check the proportion of vec_cost to total cost of vec_cost and non vec_cost, and penalize only if the proportion exceeds the threshold specified by this parameter.  The default value is 85."
msgstr "Wanneer costing vir lus vektorisering, ons waarskynlik hoef na penalize die lus body koste as die existing koste model mag nie adequately reflect delays van unavailable vektor resources. Ons collect die koste vir gevektoriseer stellings en non-vectorized stellings separately, kontroleer die proportion van vec_koste na totale koste van vec_koste en non vec_koste, en penalize slegs as die proportion oorskry die drempel gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter. Die verstek waarde is 85 nie."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:664
#, no-c-format
msgid "Like parameter rs6000-density-pct-threshold, we also check the total sum of vec_cost and non vec_cost, and penalize only if the sum exceeds the threshold specified by this parameter.  The default value is 70."
msgstr "Like parameter rs6000-density-pct-threshold, ons ook kontroleer die totale som van vec_koste en non vec_koste, en penalize slegs as die som oorskry die drempel gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter. Die verstek waarde is 70."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:670
#, no-c-format
msgid "When both heuristics with rs6000-density-pct-threshold and rs6000-density-size-threshold are satisfied, we decide to penalize the loop body cost by the value which is specified by this parameter.  The default value is 10."
msgstr "Wanneer beide heuristics met rs6000-density-pct-threshold en rs6000-density-size-threshold is bevredig, ons decide na penalize die lus body koste deur die waarde wat is gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter. Die verstek waarde is 10."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:677
#, no-c-format
msgid "When costing for loop vectorization, we probably need to penalize the loop body cost by accounting for excess strided or elementwise loads.  We collect the numbers for general statements and load statements according to the information for statements to be vectorized, check the proportion of load statements, and penalize only if the proportion exceeds the threshold specified by this parameter.  The default value is 45."
msgstr "Wanneer costing vir lus vektorisering, ons waarskynlik hoef na penalize die lus body koste deur accounting vir excess strided of elementwise loads. Ons collect die numbers vir general stellings en laai stellings according na die inligting vir stellings na wees gevektoriseer, kontroleer die proportion van laai stellings, en penalize slegs as die proportion oorskry die drempel gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter. Die verstek waarde is 45."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:686
#, no-c-format
msgid "Like parameter rs6000-density-load-pct-threshold, we also check if the total number of load statements exceeds the threshold specified by this parameter, and penalize only if it's satisfied.  The default value is 20."
msgstr "Like parameter rs6000-density-load-pct-threshold, ons ook kontroleer as die totale aantal laai stellings oorskry die drempel gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter, en penalize slegs as it's bevredig. Die verstek waarde is 20."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:692 config/loongarch/loongarch.opt:334
#, no-c-format
msgid "Indicate how many non memory access vector instructions can be issued per cycle, it's used in unroll factor determination for autovectorizer.  The default value is 4."
msgstr "Indicate how veel non geheue toegang vektor instruksies kan wees issued per cycle, it's gebruik in rol uit faktor determination vir autovectorizer. Die verstek waarde is 4."

#: config/rs6000/rs6000.opt:698
#, no-c-format
msgid "When reduction factor computed for a loop exceeds the threshold specified by this parameter, prefer to unroll this loop.  The default value is 1."
msgstr "Wanneer vermindering faktor bereken vir a lus oorskry die drempel gespesifiseer deur hierdie parameter, prefer na rol uit hierdie lus. Die verstek waarde is 1."

