#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is used internally. Indicate presence of a processor erratum.  Do not skip 32-bit instructions."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is gebruik internally. Indicate presence van a processor erratum. moenie slaan oor 32-bis instruksies."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is used internally. Enable Read-Modify-Write (RMW) instructions support/use."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is gebruik internally. Aktiveer Read-Modify-Write (RMW) instruksies ondersteun/gebruik."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:62
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is on per default in order to work around PR118012."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is op per verstek om te work rondom PR118012."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Allow to use nonzero_bits() in some insn conditions."
msgstr "Optimering. Laat toe na gebruik nie-nul_bisse() in some insn conditions nie."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:70
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is used internally for multilib generation and selection.  Assume RJMP / RCALL can target all program memory."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is gebruik internally vir multilib generation en selection. Neem aan RJMP / RCALL kan teiken alle program geheue."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use an 8-bit 'int' type."
msgstr "Gebruik 'n 8-bis 'int' tipe."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the stack pointer without disabling interrupts."
msgstr "Change die stapel wyser sonder disabling interrupts."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:82
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mbranch-cost=<cost>\tOptimization. Set the branch costs for conditional branch instructions.  Reasonable values are small, non-negative integers.  The default branch cost is 0."
msgstr "-mbranch-cost=<koste>\tOptimering. Stel die vertakking costs vir voorwaardelike vertakking instruksies. Reasonable waardes is klein, non-negative integers. Die verstek vertakking koste is 0."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:86
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Treat main as if it had attribute OS_task."
msgstr "Optimering. Treat main as as dit het kenmerk OS_task."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change only the low 8 bits of the stack pointer."
msgstr "Change slegs die lae 8 bisse van die stapel wyser."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Relax branches."
msgstr "Optimering. Relax branches."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Make the linker relaxation machine assume that a program counter wrap-around occurs."
msgstr "Make die skakelaar relaxation machine neem aan wat a program teller wrap-around occurs."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Accumulate outgoing function arguments and acquire/release the needed stack space for outgoing function arguments in function prologue/epilogue.  Without this option, outgoing arguments are pushed before calling a function and popped afterwards.  This option can lead to reduced code size for functions that call many functions that get their arguments on the stack like, for example printf."
msgstr "Optimering. Accumulate outgoing funksie argumente en acquire/stel vry die benodig stapel space vir outgoing funksie argumente in funksie prologue/epilogue. Sonder hierdie opsie, outgoing argumente is pushed voor oproep a funksie en popped afterwards. Hierdie opsie kan lead na reduced kode grootte vir funksies wat oproep veel funksies wat get hul argumente op die stapel like, vir example printf."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:112
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Split shifts of 4-byte values into a byte shift and a residual bit shift."
msgstr "Optimering. Split shifts van 4-greep waardes in a greep verskuiwing en a residual bis verskuiwing."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:116
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Split most of the load and store instructions into byte load and stores."
msgstr "Optimering. Split most van die laai en stoor instruksies in greep laai en stores."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. When accessing RAM, use X as imposed by the hardware, i.e. just use pre-decrement, post-increment and indirect addressing with the X register.  Without this option, the compiler may assume that there is an addressing mode X+const similar to Y+const and Z+const and emit instructions to emulate such an addressing mode for X."
msgstr "Optimering. Wanneer toegang tot RAM, gebruik X as imposed deur die hardware, i.e. net gebruik pre-decrement, post-increment en indirekte addressing met die X register. Sonder hierdie opsie, die kompileerder mag neem aan wat daar is 'n addressing modus X+const soortgelyke na Y+const en Z+const en genereer instruksies na emulate sulke 'n addressing modus vir X."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:124
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is used internally. The device has the bitfield NVMCTRL_CTRLB.FLMAP."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is gebruik internally. Die device het die bitfield NVMCTRL_CTRLB.FLMAP."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:128
#, no-c-format
msgid "The device has the .rodata section located in the RAM area."
msgstr "Die device het die.rodata afdeling located in die RAM area."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option is used internally for multilib generation and selection. The device has no SPH special function register."
msgstr "Hierdie opsie is gebruik internally vir multilib generation en selection. Die device het geen SPH special funksie register."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Split register additions from load/store instructions. Most useful on Reduced Tiny."
msgstr "Optimering. Split register additions van laai/stoor instruksies. Most useful op Reduced Tiny."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:141
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mfuse-add=<0,2>\tOptimization. Split register additions from load/store instructions. Most useful on Reduced Tiny."
msgstr "-mfuse-add=<0,2>\tOptimering. Split register additions van laai/stoor instruksies. Most useful op Reduced Tiny."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:145
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn if the address space of an address is changed."
msgstr "waarsku as die adres space van 'n adres is verander."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:149
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn if the ISR is misspelled, i.e. without __vector prefix. Enabled by default."
msgstr "waarsku as die ISR is misspelled, i.e. sonder __vektor voorvoegsel. Geaktiveer deur verstek."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow to use truncation instead of rounding towards zero for fractional fixed-point types."
msgstr "Laat toe na gebruik afkapping in plaas van afronding towards nul vir fractional fixed-point tipes."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:157
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Run a post-reload pass that tweaks move instructions."
msgstr "Optimering. Run a post-reload gee deur wat tweaks skuif instruksies."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:161
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mfuse-move=<0,23>\tOptimization. Run a post-reload pass that tweaks move instructions."
msgstr "-mfuse-move=<0,23>\tOptimering. Run a post-reload gee deur wat tweaks skuif instruksies."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:165
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimization. Fuse some move insns after insn combine."
msgstr "Optimering. Fuse some skuif insns ná insn combine."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assume that all data in static storage can be accessed by LDS / STS instructions.  This option is only useful for reduced Tiny devices like ATtiny40."
msgstr "Neem aan wat alle data in statiese berging kan wees accessed deur LDS / STS instruksies. Hierdie opsie is slegs useful vir reduced Tiny devices like ATtiny40."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mdouble=<BITS>\tUse <BITS> bits wide double type."
msgstr "-mdouble=<BISSE>\tGebruik <BISSE> bisse wyd double tipe."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mlong-double=<BITS>\tUse <BITS> bits wide long double type."
msgstr "-mlong-double=<BISSE>\tGebruik <BISSE> bisse wyd lang double tipe."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:181
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not link against the device-specific library lib<MCU>.a."
msgstr "moenie skakel teen die device-specific biblioteek lib<MCU>.a."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not use the device-specific specs file device-specs/specs-<MCU>."
msgstr "moenie gebruik die device-specific spesifikasies lêer device-specs/specs-<MCU>."

#: config/avr/avr.opt:189
#, no-c-format
msgid "Available BITS selections:"
msgstr "Beskikbaar BISSE selections:"

#: config/cris/cris.opt:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Work around bug in multiplication instruction."
msgstr "Work rondom fout in vermenigvuldiging instruksie."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compile for ETRAX 4 (CRIS v3)."
msgstr "Kompileer vir ETRAX 4 (CRIS v3)."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compile for ETRAX 100 (CRIS v8)."
msgstr "Kompileer vir ETRAX 100 (CRIS v8)."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emit verbose debug information in assembly code."
msgstr "Genereer verbose ontfout inligting in assembly kode."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:71
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not use condition codes from normal instructions."
msgstr "moenie gebruik voorwaarde codes van normale instruksies."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:80
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not emit addressing modes with side-effect assignment."
msgstr "moenie genereer addressing modes met side-effect toekenning."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not tune stack alignment."
msgstr "moenie tune stapel belyning."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not tune writable data alignment."
msgstr "moenie tune writable data belyning."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:107
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not tune code and read-only data alignment."
msgstr "moenie tune kode en read-only data belyning."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:112 config/cris/cris.opt:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Align code and data to 32 bits."
msgstr "Align kode en data na 32 bisse."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:122 config/cris/cris.opt:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Align code and data to 16 bits."
msgstr "Align kode en data na 16 bisse."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:132 config/cris/cris.opt:137
#, no-c-format
msgid "Don't align items in code or data."
msgstr "Don't align items in kode of data."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not emit function prologue or epilogue."
msgstr "moenie genereer funksie prologue of epilogue."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the most feature-enabling options allowed by other options."
msgstr "Gebruik die most feature-enabling opsies toegelaat deur ander opsies."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:162
#, no-c-format
msgid "Override -mbest-lib-options."
msgstr "Oorheers -mbest-lib-options."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "-march=ARCH\tGenerate code for the specified chip or CPU version."
msgstr "-march=ARCH\tGenereer kode vir die gespesifiseer chip of CPU weergawe."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mtune=ARCH\tTune alignment for the specified chip or CPU version."
msgstr "-mtune=ARCH\tTune belyning vir die gespesifiseer chip of CPU weergawe."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "-mmax-stackframe=SIZE\tWarn when a stackframe is larger than the specified size."
msgstr "-mmax-stackframe=GROOTTE\twaarsku wanneer a stackframe is larger as die gespesifiseer grootte."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:184
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emit traps as \"break 8\", default for CRIS v3 and up.  If disabled, calls to abort() are used."
msgstr "Genereer traps as \"break 8\", verstek vir CRIS v3 en op. As gedeaktiveer, oproepe na breek af() is gebruik."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:188
#, no-c-format
msgid "Emit checks causing \"break 8\" instructions to execute when applying atomic builtins on misaligned memory."
msgstr "Genereer checks causing \"break 8\" instruksies na execute wanneer toepassing van atomiese builtins op misaligned geheue."

#: config/cris/cris.opt:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Handle atomic builtins that may be applied to unaligned data by calling library functions. Overrides -mtrap-unaligned-atomic."
msgstr "Handle atomiese builtins wat mag wees toegepas na unaligned data deur oproep biblioteek funksies. Overrides -mtrap-unaligned-atomic."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:7
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use a lightweight configuration of printf and puts to reduce code size. For single-threaded applications, not requiring reentrant I/O only. Requires Newlib Nano IO."
msgstr "Gebruik a lightweight opstelling van printf en puts na verminder kode grootte. Vir single-threaded applications, nie wat vereis reentrant I/O slegs. Vereis Newlib Nano IO nie."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Force assembly output to always use hex constants."
msgstr "Force assembly afvoer na altyd gebruik hex konstantes."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify the MCU to build for."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die MCU na build vir."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:19
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn if an MCU name is unrecognized or conflicts with other options (default: on)."
msgstr "waarsku as 'n MCU naam is onherkende of bots met ander opsies (verstek: op)."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:23
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn if devices.csv is not found or there are problem parsing it (default: on)."
msgstr "waarsku as devices.csv is nie gevind of daar is problem ontleding dit (verstek: op) nie."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify the ISA to build for: msp430, msp430x, msp430xv2."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die ISA na build vir: msp430, msp430x, msp430xv2."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:52
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select large model - 20-bit addresses/pointers."
msgstr "Select groot model - 20-bis addresses/wysers."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select small model - 16-bit addresses/pointers (default)."
msgstr "Select klein model - 16-bis addresses/wysers (verstek)."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optimize opcode sizes at link time."
msgstr "Optimeer opkode sizes by skakel tyd."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:67 config/pru/pru.opt:26
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use a minimum runtime (no static initializers or ctors) for memory-constrained devices."
msgstr "Gebruik a minimum looptyd (geen statiese initializers of ctors) vir memory-constrained devices."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:74
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify the type of hardware multiply to support."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die tipe van hardware multiply na ondersteun."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify whether functions should be placed into the lower or upper memory regions, or if they should be shuffled between the regions (either) for best fit (default: lower)."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of funksies moet wees placed in die onderste of boonste geheue regions, of as hulle moet wees shuffled tussen die regions (either) vir beste fit (verstek: onderste)."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:100
#, no-c-format
msgid "Specify whether variables should be placed into the lower or upper memory regions, or if they should be shuffled between the regions (either) for best fit (default: lower)."
msgstr "Spesifiseer of veranderlikes moet wees placed in die onderste of boonste geheue regions, of as hulle moet wees shuffled tussen die regions (either) vir beste fit (verstek: onderste)."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:104
#, no-c-format
msgid "Add the .lower prefix to section names when compiling with -m{code,data}-region=lower (disabled by default)."
msgstr "Voeg by die.onderste voorvoegsel na afdeling name wanneer compiling met -m{kode,data}-streek=onderste (gedeaktiveer deur verstek)."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:123
#, no-c-format
msgid "Passes on a request to the assembler to enable fixes for various silicon errata."
msgstr "Passes op a request na die samesteller na aktiveer fixes vir various silicon errata."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:127
#, no-c-format
msgid "Passes on a request to the assembler to warn about various silicon errata."
msgstr "Passes op a request na die samesteller na waarsku oor various silicon errata."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:131
#, no-c-format
msgid "The path to devices.csv.  The GCC driver can normally locate devices.csv itself and pass this option to the compiler, so the user shouldn't need to pass this."
msgstr "Die pad na devices.csv. Die GCC driver kan normaalweg locate devices.csv itself en gee deur hierdie opsie na die kompileerder, so die gebruiker shouldn't hoef na gee deur hierdie."

#: config/msp430/msp430.opt:136
#, no-c-format
msgid "For shift operations by a constant amount, which require an individual instruction to shift by one position, set the maximum number of inline shift instructions (maximum value 64) to emit instead of using the corresponding __mspabi helper function. The default value is 4."
msgstr "Vir verskuiwing bewerkings deur a konstant hoeveelheid, wat vereis 'n individual instruksie na verskuiwing deur one posisie, stel die maksimum aantal inline verskuiwing instruksies (maksimum waarde 64) na genereer in plaas van gebruik die ooreenstemmende __mspabi helper funksie. Die verstek waarde is 4."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use 4 media accumulators."
msgstr "Gebruik 4 media accumulators."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use 8 media accumulators."
msgstr "Gebruik 8 media accumulators."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable label alignment optimizations."
msgstr "Aktiveer etiket belyning optimizations."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dynamically allocate cc registers."
msgstr "Dynamically wys toe cc registers."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the cost of branches."
msgstr "Stel die koste van branches."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable conditional execution other than moves/scc."
msgstr "Aktiveer voorwaardelike uitvoering ander as moves/scc."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the maximum length of conditionally-executed sequences."
msgstr "Change die maksimum lengte van conditionally-executed sequences."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the number of temporary registers that are available to conditionally-executed sequences."
msgstr "Change die aantal tydelike registers wat is beskikbaar na conditionally-executed sequences."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable conditional moves."
msgstr "Aktiveer voorwaardelike moves."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the target CPU type."
msgstr "Stel die teiken CPU tipe."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Known FR-V CPUs (for use with the -mcpu= option):"
msgstr "Known FR-V CPUs (vir gebruik met die -mcpu= opsie):"

#: config/frv/frv.opt:122
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use fp double instructions."
msgstr "Gebruik fp double instruksies."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:126
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the ABI to allow double word insns."
msgstr "Change die ABI na laat toe double woord insns."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:134
#, no-c-format
msgid "Just use icc0/fcc0."
msgstr "Net gebruik icc0/fcc0."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:138
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only use 32 FPRs."
msgstr "Slegs gebruik 32 FPRs."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:142
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use 64 FPRs."
msgstr "Gebruik 64 FPRs."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Only use 32 GPRs."
msgstr "Slegs gebruik 32 GPRs."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:150
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use 64 GPRs."
msgstr "Gebruik 64 GPRs."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:154
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable use of GPREL for read-only data in FDPIC."
msgstr "Aktiveer gebruik van GPREL vir read-only data in FDPIC."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:166
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable PIC support for building libraries."
msgstr "Aktiveer PIC ondersteun vir building biblioteke."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "Follow the EABI linkage requirements."
msgstr "Volg die EABI binding requirements."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:174
#, no-c-format
msgid "Disallow direct calls to global functions."
msgstr "Disallow direkte oproepe na globale funksies."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:178
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use media instructions."
msgstr "Gebruik media instruksies."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:182
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use multiply add/subtract instructions."
msgstr "Gebruik multiply voeg by/subtract instruksies."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:186
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable optimizing &&/|| in conditional execution."
msgstr "Aktiveer optimizing &&/|| in voorwaardelike uitvoering."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:190
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable nested conditional execution optimizations."
msgstr "Aktiveer geneste voorwaardelike uitvoering optimizations."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:195
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not mark ABI switches in e_flags."
msgstr "moenie mark ABI switches in e_vlae."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:199
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove redundant membars."
msgstr "Verwyder oortollige membars."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pack VLIW instructions."
msgstr "Pak VLIW instruksies."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:207
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable setting GPRs to the result of comparisons."
msgstr "Aktiveer setting GPRs na die resultaat van comparisons."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:212
#, no-c-format
msgid "Change the amount of scheduler lookahead."
msgstr "Change die hoeveelheid van scheduler lookahead."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:220
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assume a large TLS segment."
msgstr "Neem aan a groot TLS segment."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:224
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not assume a large TLS segment."
msgstr "moenie neem aan a groot TLS segment."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:229
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cause gas to print tomcat statistics."
msgstr "Cause gas na druk tomcat statistics."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:234
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link with the library-pic libraries."
msgstr "Skakel met die library-pic biblioteke."

#: config/frv/frv.opt:238
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow branches to be packed with other instructions."
msgstr "Laat toe branches na wees packed met ander instruksies."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "For intrinsics library: pass all parameters in registers."
msgstr "Vir intrinsics biblioteek: gee deur alle parameters in registers."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use register stack for parameters and return value."
msgstr "Gebruik register stapel vir parameters en terugkeer waarde."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use call-clobbered registers for parameters and return value."
msgstr "Gebruik call-clobbered registers vir parameters en terugkeer waarde."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use epsilon-respecting floating point compare instructions."
msgstr "Gebruik epsilon-respecting dryfpunt vergelyk instruksies."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:41
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use zero-extending memory loads, not sign-extending ones."
msgstr "Gebruik zero-extending geheue loads, nie sign-extending ones nie."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate divide results with reminder having the same sign as the divisor (not the dividend)."
msgstr "Genereer divide resultate met reminder having die dieselfde teken as die divisor (nie die dividend) nie."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Prepend global symbols with \":\" (for use with PREFIX)."
msgstr "Prepend globale simbole met \":\" (vir gebruik met VOORVOEGSEL)."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Do not provide a default start-address 0x100 of the program."
msgstr "moenie verskaf a verstek start-address 0x100 van die program."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link to emit program in ELF format (rather than mmo)."
msgstr "Skakel na genereer program in ELF formaat (eerder as mmo)."

#: config/mmix/mmix.opt:61
#, no-c-format
