#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn about C++ polymorphic types where adding final keyword would improve code quality."
msgstr "waarsku oor C++ polimorfiese tipes waar adding finale sleutelwoord sou improve kode quality."

#: common.opt:820
#, no-c-format
msgid "Warn about C++ virtual methods where adding final keyword would improve code quality."
msgstr "waarsku oor C++ virtuele methods waar adding finale sleutelwoord sou improve kode quality."

